  data: {
    LLM: 'Game: Napalm. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: "Napalm (Whipsaw/3-5-7) is a multi-stage poker variant emphasizing bluffing. 4-7 players. 52-card deck. Three stages: Stage 1 (2 cards, best high), Stage 2 (+3 community, best LOW 5-card), Stage 3 (+2 more, best HIGH 5-card). Each stage: declare 'yes/no' if you think you have best hand. Single yes=token. Multiple yes=side bets. First to collect 5 tokens wins the pot.",
    objective: 'Be the first to collect five tokens to win the pot; players also compete in side bets matching the pot amount each time multiple players declare yes.',
    gameplay: 'Ante. Stage 1: 2 cards, declare yes/no (best high 2-card). Stage 2: 3 community cards, yes/no (best LOW 5-card). Stage 3: 2 more hole cards, yes/no (best HIGH 5-card of 7). Single yes=1 token. Multiple yes=show hands, loser pays pot-sized side bet to winner.',
